      "title": "At least 15 people may be missing after flash flood in Arizona’s Grand Canyon",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/grand-canyon-flash-flood-arizona-people-missing-evacuated",
      "description": "<p>Dozens evacuated after flash-flood event near Bright Angel Canyon and Phantom Ranch, officials say</p><p>At least 15 people may be missing or unaccounted for after a major flash <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/flooding\">flood</a> swept through the Grand Canyon national park in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/arizona\">Arizona</a> on Saturday afternoon, according to the National Park Service.</p><p>The flash-flood event occurred in the area of Bright Angel Canyon and the Phantom Ranch, where park staff and the Arizona department of public safety have evacuated more than 60 people as of Sunday morning.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/grand-canyon-flash-flood-arizona-people-missing-evacuated\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
